WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.353
Where did last month go?

2
00:00:03.653 --> 00:00:07.489
When a month ends, your journal hands it back, on one card.

3
00:00:08.789 --> 00:00:13.847
Tap Watch, and the whole month plays, oldest first, in your own words.

4
00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:19.661
It only looks back. No streaks, no targets.

5
00:00:20.961 --> 00:00:24.892
And every month waits in the calendar, ready to watch again.
